t</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Those who are looking for Greek shenanigans, this weekend we also announced <b>They Came from the Cyclops' Cave</b>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which is probably why they postponed Aegis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-15T12:26:38-07:00","id":1452364,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aether/1451830-tc-aether?p=1452363#post1452363\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Which is probably why they postponed Aegis.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> *sigh*<br /> <br /> I keep hammering this in: \u00c6gis is on my list of things I want to do. There are a lot of things on that list. It's not a guaranteed product. It's not an approved product. There's no one working on it. There's no outline.<br /> <br /> \u00c6gis has <i>not </i>been &quot;postponed&quot; because it does not exist.<br /> <br /> I know people got excited about the idea of it, but that doesn't mean it's a real thing that's happening.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d",